# All of these are OPTIONAL. College OS runs completely free with zero keys set.
# Copy this file to .env.local for local dev, or add the variables in the
# Vercel dashboard under Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Never commit a real .env.local file.

# Optional: unlocks a smarter, model-generated version of the AI Assistant
# and the news "why it matters" summaries. Without it, both features still
# work using a free rule-based engine built into the app.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: Stage 2. Needed only when you're ready to wire up real Google
# Calendar read-only sync. See README.md "Google Calendar (Stage 2)".
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
